OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and partly cloudy. Then
OL,7,Fbecoming rather cloudy overnight with
OL,8,Fa few light showers possible across
OL,9,FAngus and Fife. Light and variable
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,13,Fcloudy at times. Chance of a few light
OL,14,Fshowers, these mainly across Angus,
OL,15,FFife and Dundee.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,18,Fsettled although rather cloudy at
OL,19,Ftimes. Chance of one or two light
OL,20,Fshowers in the east. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
